        "title": "Sociology of Religion",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Sociology of religion treats religious phenomena as social facts — producible,\nreproducible, and analyzable through the same methods applied to any other social\nphenomenon. The three founding theorists (Durkheim, Weber, Marx) each gave religion\na different social function and generated different research programs."
